From 39bb057119b31dc54d1ee6af0c5282e1d1a7eb3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <devnull@projectluma.local>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 10:31:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] style: remove duplicate outer title divider

The title row and work islands are separate native surfaces.  The title bar's
old lower hairline visually joined them and disagreed with Notes and
Calculator.  Keep the functional secondary-toolbar divider inside the Filer
content island, but remove this duplicate window-level edge.
---
 src/resources/style.css | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/resources/style.css b/src/resources/style.css
--- a/src/resources/style.css
+++ b/src/resources/style.css
@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@
   background-color: @luma_window;
   background-image: none;
   color: @luma_ink;
-  box-shadow: inset 0 -1px @luma_line;
+  box-shadow: none;
 }
 
 @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
